#: ../../tools/quickgo_tools.rst:32 5fd0db0a0cd54dfd8abb3b8c21acfbe9
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search Gene Ontology (GO) annotations for a specific "
"gene product using the EBI QuickGO browser. Returns GO terms annotated to"
" the protein/gene with evidence codes, qualifiers, and annotation "
"sources. Accepts UniProtKB accessions (e.g., 'UniProtKB:P04637' for "
"TP53). Provides more detailed annotation data than the standard GO API, "
"including evidence provenance and assigned-by information. Useful for "
"understanding gene function, localization, and biological processes."
msgstr ""

