#: ../../tools/quickgo_tools.rst:36 bfb7a5753ae1453c94377bdcf0ad7762
msgid ""
"``gene_product_id`` (string) (required) Gene product identifier, "
"typically a UniProtKB accession. Format: 'UniProtKB:P04637' (TP53), "
"'UniProtKB:P38398' (BRCA1), 'UniProtKB:P00533' (EGFR)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/quickgo_tools.rst:39 a63102b71a0d42fc914b1e4e0ad2385d
msgid ""
"``aspect`` (string, null) (optional) Filter by GO aspect: "
"'biological\\_process', 'molecular\\_function', or "
"'cellular\\_component'. Default: all aspects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/quickgo_tools.rst:42 3f445196422446f4a2dca5f635e1b376
msgid ""
"``taxon_id`` (integer, null) (optional) Filter by NCBI taxonomy ID. "
"Example: 9606 (human), 10090 (mouse)."
msgstr ""

