#: ../../tools/quickgo_tools.rst:140 e804e60c92a64ae8ab79a30efffe5d4a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed information about a specific Gene Ontology "
"(GO) term from the EBI QuickGO browser. Returns the term name, "
"definition, aspect "
"(biological\\_process/molecular\\_function/cellular\\_component), "
"synonyms, cross-references, and number of child terms. More detailed than"
" the standard GO term lookup, including synonym types and cross-"
"references to other ontologies. Example: GO:0006915 returns 'apoptotic "
"process' with its full definition and 29 child terms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/quickgo_tools.rst:144 d049f520b2c048c5a8eda5188b9a39e7
msgid ""
"``go_id`` (string) (required) Gene Ontology term accession. Examples: "
"'GO:0006915' (apoptotic process), 'GO:0008150' (biological process), "
"'GO:0005634' (nucleus), 'GO:0016020' (membrane)."
msgstr ""

